---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "{% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}/work.html{% else %}/work/page/{{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}/index.html{% endif %}"
title: 生活记录｜赵荣力
description: 赵荣力的生活记录，分享旅行、日常与和家人朋友相处的时光。
activeNav: work
hasLightbox: true
hasMath: true
pagination:
  data: collections.life
  size: 10
  reverse: true
---
<div class="main-content">
  <header>
    <h1 class="extra-title">这大概就是我的生活吧</h1>
    <p class="stream-intro"><em>think more</em></p>
    {% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}<a class="life-archive-jump" href="#life-archive">按年份浏览往年记录 ↓</a>{% endif %}
  </header>
  {% for entry in pagination.items %}
    {% include "partials/life-entry.njk" %}
  {% endfor %}
  {% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}{% include "partials/life-archive.njk" %}{% endif %}
  {% if pagination.href.previous or pagination.href.next %}
  <nav class="pagination" aria-label="生活记录分页">
    {% if pagination.href.previous %}<a href="{{ pagination.href.previous }}">← 最新记录</a>{% endif %}
    {% if pagination.href.next %}<a href="{{ pagination.href.next }}">更早的记录 →</a>{% endif %}
  </nav>
  {% endif %}
</div>
